      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُصْلِحٌ</span></b>  [act. part. n. of 4, q. v.]. One says,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ مُصْلِحٌ فِى أُمُورِهِ وَأَعْمَالِهِ</span> [<i>A man who does
